<title>INDIA: India Mah Scooters plans bonus issue.</title>
<headline>India Mah Scooters plans bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Maharashtra Scooters Ltd will meet on May 7 to consider issue of bonus equity shares, the firm said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The board will also finalise accounts and recommend dividend for the year ended March 31, 1997 at the same meeting, it said.</p>
<p>The company is part of the scooter giant Bajaj Auto group.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
